        "Apply the translation by vector $\\begin{pmatrix} 4 \\\\ 1 \\end{pmatrix}$:\n$$(4, -22) \\longrightarrow (4 + 4, -22 + 1) = (8, -21)$$\nThus, the minimum point of the transformed curve is $(8, -21)$."
